WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.229
A dance class ends.

00:00:02.249 --> 00:00:04.590
The practice should come home with you.

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:10.478
Eight Again turns one short lesson into a five-minute rehearsal, controlled with the Fire TV remote.

00:00:12.315 --> 00:00:13.563
App: Watch the movement.

00:00:23.053 --> 00:00:23.988
App: Ready. Make room.

00:00:24.139 --> 00:00:28.075
Remote pause: the countdown holds.

00:00:28.591 --> 00:00:30.583
App: Ready. Make room.

00:00:32.316 --> 00:00:33.228
App: Your turn.

00:00:33.486 --> 00:00:42.349
Your practice time. The example returns automatically.

00:00:44.078 --> 00:00:45.326
App: Watch the movement.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:53.700
Polly prompts play locally while you move.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:57.070
The D-pad keeps the controls within reach.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:01.634
Choose normal speed, move between sections, and press Back to pause.

00:01:01.654 --> 00:01:04.230
Your practice timer pauses, too.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:12.036
Close the app and open it again.

00:01:12.056 --> 00:01:17.573
The second section, normal speed, and today's completed round are still here.

00:01:17.593 --> 00:01:19.635
Press Continue to resume.

00:01:19.655 --> 00:01:23.478
Daily counts reset with the date, keeping your section and speed.

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:28.040
App: Practice complete. See you tomorrow.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:37.120
For a class trial, we prepare a teacher's own clip as three named practice sections.

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:41.614
Our included sample is Neil Sweeney's openly licensed Six Step.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:46.881
Get the source, installable packages, and free teacher trial on the project page.

00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:53.398
Built and recorded on the official Vega Virtual Device, using React Native and Vega OS one point two.
